<Layout webptitle="BayPhon2026 @ SJSU: Logistics" >
	<h2>Logistics</h2>
	<p>
        If you haven't already, please sign up at <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeVycQgredZZ5Mm7XmWrQV4ABSCaKyAtGqBb-tZnCRD0YdaDw/viewform" target="_blank">this link</a> so we can calculate attendance and headcount!
	</p>
    <h3>Talks</h3>

    The workshop will take place in SJSU's Engineering Building, Room 285/7.  Talks will be in the 20 min talk + 5 min question format with ample time at breaks for discussion. 
    <br><br>
    Presenters using printed handouts should plan to bring their own as there is no commercial copying service on campus.
    <br><br>
    For presenters using slides, the venue has a projector and speakers, with both an HDMI & USB-C cables. Presenters should bring their own laptop and adaptor (if necessary).
    
    <h3>Posters</h3>
    
    Posters session will be one hour. Poster boards will be available to accomodate standard conference-sized posters (up to ~4 feet in length).
</Layout>
